      "settings": {
        "html": "<!--\n  NOTA DE ENTREGA\n  ───────────────\n  Este bloco foi desenvolvido para ser colado diretamente em uma página do Shopify,\n  dentro do editor de conteúdo ou de uma seção de HTML personalizado.\n\n  NÃO inclui header, menu de navegação, barra superior, footer ou rodapé.\n\n  IMAGENS: algumas imagens de cases ainda usam placeholder. Substitua pelos URLs reais da Hyper Island.\n  LINKS: todos os links principais estão preenchidos com URLs reais. Verifique antes de publicar.\n  FORMULÁRIO: já integrado com HubSpot (portalId 1588780, formId ba1144b5-f5a2-45e2-ad47-a6ce34de1715).\n-->\n\n<style>\n/* Montserrat via Google Fonts — usado em subtítulos, textos, botões e números grandes */\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap');\n\n/* ============================================================\n   HYPER ISLAND · HOME REDESIGN\n   Estilos completamente escopados em .hi-home-redesign\n   Não alteram o tema global do Shopify\n   ============================================================ */\n\n.hi-home-redesign *,\n.hi-home-redesign *::before,\n.hi-home-redesign *::after {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\n.hi-home-redesign {\n  --color-black: #111111;\n  --color-black-deep: #000000;\n  --color-white: #FFFFFF;\n  --color-bg-light: #F5F5F2;\n  --color-text-secondary: #666666;\n  --color-border: #D9D9D6;\n  --color-orange: #FF7300;\n  --color-orange-soft: #FFF1E6;\n  --color-text-main: #333333;\n\n  /* Montserrat para subtítulos, textos e botões.\n     Fallback para fonte do sistema caso Montserrat não esteja carregada no Shopify. */\n  --font-main: 'Montserrat', inherit, sans-serif;\n  /* Fonte herdada do tema Shopify para os títulos editoriais grandes */\n  --font-heading: inherit;\n\n  --radius-sm: 2px;\n  --radius-btn: 100px;\n  --radius-md: 4px;\n\n  --transition: 0.22s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n\n  font-family: var(--font-main);\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  overflow-x: hidden;\n}\n\n/* ── CONTAINER ── */\n.hi-container {\n  max-width: 1240px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 0 40px;\n}\n\n/* ── UTILITY ── */\n.hi-eyebrow {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n.hi-reveal {\n  opacity: 0;\n  transform: translateY(28px);\n  transition: opacity 0.65s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),\n              transform 0.65s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n}\n.hi-reveal.hi-visible {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: translateY(0);\n}\n.hi-reveal-delay-1 { transition-delay: 0.1s; }\n.hi-reveal-delay-2 { transition-delay: 0.2s; }\n.hi-reveal-delay-3 { transition-delay: 0.3s; }\n.hi-reveal-delay-4 { transition-delay: 0.4s; }\n\n/* ── BUTTONS ── */\n.hi-btn {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  font-family: var(--font-main);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  padding: 14px 28px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-btn);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  border: 2px solid transparent;\n}\n.hi-btn-primary {\n  background: var(--color-black);\n  color: var(--color-white);\n  border-color: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-btn-primary:hover {\n  background: var(--color-orange);\n  border-color: var(--color-orange);\n  color: var(--color-white);\n}\n.hi-btn-outline {\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  border-color: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-btn-outline:hover {\n  background: var(--color-black);\n  color: var(--color-white);\n}\n.hi-btn-orange {\n  background: var(--color-orange);\n  color: var(--color-white);\n  border-color: var(--color-orange);\n}\n.hi-btn-orange:hover {\n  background: var(--color-black);\n  border-color: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-btn-white {\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  border-color: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-btn-white:hover {\n  background: var(--color-black);\n  color: var(--color-white);\n}\n.hi-link-tertiary {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-link-tertiary:hover {\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n}\n.hi-link-tertiary::after {\n  content: '→';\n  font-size: 15px;\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   1. HERO\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-hero {\n  padding: 80px 0 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--color-white);\n}\n.hi-hero__inner {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 0;\n  align-items: stretch;\n  min-height: 560px;\n}\n.hi-hero__content {\n  padding: 60px 60px 80px 0;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n.hi-hero__title {\n  font-size: clamp(68px, 7.5vw, 98px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n.hi-hero__title em {\n  font-style: normal;\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n}\n.hi-hero__subtitle {\n  font-size: 17px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  max-width: 480px;\n  margin-bottom: 40px;\n}\n.hi-hero__ctas {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n.hi-hero__image-col {\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.hi-hero__img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n  filter: grayscale(15%);\n  transition: filter 0.4s ease;\n}\n.hi-hero__img:hover {\n  filter: grayscale(0%);\n}\n.hi-hero__badge {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 28px;\n  left: 28px;\n  background: var(--color-orange);\n  color: var(--color-white);\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  padding: 8px 16px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  z-index: 2;\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   2. BARRA DE PERFIL\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-profiles {\n  padding: 80px 0;\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-profiles__header {\n  margin-bottom: 48px;\n}\n.hi-profiles__title {\n  font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 38px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.05;\n}\n.hi-profiles__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 0;\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-profile-card {\n  padding: 40px 36px;\n  border-right: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.hi-profile-card:last-child {\n  border-right: none;\n}\n.hi-profile-card::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;\n  height: 3px;\n  background: var(--color-orange);\n  transform: scaleX(0);\n  transform-origin: left;\n  transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n}\n.hi-profile-card:hover::before {\n  transform: scaleX(1);\n}\n.hi-profile-card:hover {\n  background: var(--color-bg-light);\n}\n.hi-profile-card__num {\n  font-size: 48px;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  color: var(--color-border);\n  line-height: 1;\n  letter-spacing: -0.04em;\n}\n.hi-profile-card__title {\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-profile-card__text {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  flex: 1;\n}\n.hi-profile-card__link {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-profile-card__link::after {\n  content: '→';\n}\n.hi-profile-card__link:hover {\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   3. BUSINESS TRANSFORMATION\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-b2b {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: var(--color-bg-light);\n}\n.hi-b2b__top {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 60px;\n  align-items: end;\n  margin-bottom: 64px;\n}\n.hi-b2b__title {\n  font-size: clamp(32px, 3.5vw, 52px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n}\n.hi-b2b__intro {\n  padding-top: 8px;\n}\n.hi-b2b__intro p {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n}\n.hi-b2b__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: 0;\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-b2b-card {\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  padding: 36px 28px;\n  border-right: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 14px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-b2b-card:last-child { border-right: none; }\n.hi-b2b-card:hover {\n  background: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-b2b-card:hover .hi-b2b-card__title,\n.hi-b2b-card:hover .hi-b2b-card__text {\n  color: var(--color-white);\n}\n.hi-b2b-card__marker {\n  width: 28px;\n  height: 3px;\n  background: var(--color-orange);\n  border-radius: 2px;\n}\n.hi-b2b-card__title {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-b2b-card__text {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  flex: 1;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-b2b__cta {\n  margin-top: 48px;\n  padding-top: 48px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n.hi-b2b__cta-text {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  max-width: 500px;\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   4. CASES\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-cases {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: var(--color-white);\n}\n.hi-cases__header {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 60px;\n  align-items: end;\n  margin-bottom: 60px;\n}\n.hi-cases__title {\n  font-size: clamp(30px, 3.2vw, 48px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n}\n.hi-cases__intro {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n}\n.hi-cases__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n.hi-case-card {\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-case-card:hover {\n  border-color: var(--color-orange);\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n}\n.hi-case-card__img {\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n  filter: grayscale(60%);\n  transition: filter 0.4s ease;\n}\n.hi-case-card:hover .hi-case-card__img {\n  filter: grayscale(0%);\n}\n.hi-case-card__body {\n  padding: 28px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n  flex: 1;\n}\n.hi-case-card__meta {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n.hi-case-card__company {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-case-card__cat {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n  background: var(--color-orange-soft);\n  padding: 3px 8px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n}\n.hi-case-card__text {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  flex: 1;\n}\n.hi-case-card__link {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-case-card__link::after { content: '→'; }\n.hi-case-card__link:hover { color: var(--color-orange); }\n\n/* ============================================================\n   5. CURSOS\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-courses {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: #000000;\n  color: var(--color-white);\n}\n.hi-courses__header {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 60px;\n  align-items: end;\n  margin-bottom: 72px;\n  padding-bottom: 48px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n}\n.hi-courses__eyebrow {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n.hi-courses__title {\n  font-size: clamp(30px, 3.5vw, 52px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  color: var(--color-white);\n}\n.hi-courses__intro {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\n  padding-top: 4px;\n}\n.hi-trail {\n  margin-bottom: 40px;\n}\n.hi-trail:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 0; }\n.hi-trail__title {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  padding-bottom: 12px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n}\n.hi-trail__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n.hi-course-card {\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-course-card:hover {\n  border-color: var(--color-orange);\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n}\n.hi-course-card__img-wrap {\n  position: relative;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n.hi-course-card__img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n  filter: grayscale(30%) brightness(0.85);\n  transition: filter 0.4s ease, transform 0.4s ease;\n}\n.hi-course-card:hover .hi-course-card__img {\n  filter: grayscale(0%) brightness(1);\n  transform: scale(1.04);\n}\n/* Tags com cores distintas por formato */\n.hi-course-card__format {\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 10px;\n  left: 12px;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-white);\n  background: var(--color-orange);\n  padding: 3px 9px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  z-index: 2;\n}\n/* Ao vivo — laranja principal */\n.hi-course-card__format--ao-vivo {\n  background: #FF7300;\n}\n/* Presencial — laranja mais escuro/queimado */\n.hi-course-card__format--presencial {\n  background: #C45200;\n}\n/* Gravado — laranja acastanhado/neutro */\n.hi-course-card__format--gravado {\n  background: #E89C5A;\n  color: #111111;\n}\n.hi-course-card__body {\n  padding: 18px 18px 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 8px;\n  flex: 1;\n}\n.hi-course-card__title {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  color: var(--color-white);\n  line-height: 1.25;\n}\n.hi-course-card__text {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.80);\n  flex: 1;\n}\n.hi-course-card__link {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 5px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\n.hi-course-card__link::after { content: '→'; }\n.hi-course-card__link:hover { color: var(--color-white); }\n\n/* Layout de trilhas em duas colunas no desktop */\n.hi-courses__trails {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 40px 48px;\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   6. RECURSOS GRATUITOS\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-resources {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: var(--color-bg-light);\n}\n.hi-resources__header {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 60px;\n  align-items: end;\n  margin-bottom: 60px;\n}\n.hi-resources__eyebrow-wrap {\n  grid-column: 1 / -1;\n}\n.hi-resources__title {\n  font-size: clamp(30px, 3.5vw, 52px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  margin-bottom: 0;\n}\n.hi-resources__intro {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  max-width: 560px;\n  padding-top: 8px;\n}\n.hi-resources__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: 0;\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-resource-card {\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  padding: 36px 28px;\n  border-right: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.hi-resource-card:last-child { border-right: none; }\n.hi-resource-card::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;\n  height: 3px;\n  background: var(--color-orange);\n  transform: scaleX(0);\n  transform-origin: left;\n  transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n}\n.hi-resource-card:hover::after {\n  transform: scaleX(1);\n}\n.hi-resource-card:hover {\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n}\n.hi-resource-card__icon {\n  width: 62px;\n  height: 62px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n.hi-resource-card__icon-img {\n  width: 62px;\n  height: 52px;\n  object-fit: contain;\n  display: block;\n}\n.hi-resource-card__title {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  line-height: 1.3;\n}\n.hi-resource-card__text {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  flex: 1;\n}\n.hi-resource-card__link {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-resource-card__link::after { content: '→'; }\n.hi-resource-card__link:hover { color: var(--color-orange); }\n\n/* ============================================================\n   7. IMPACTO\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-impact {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-impact__header {\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 72px;\n}\n.hi-impact__title {\n  font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 44px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n.hi-impact__intro {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  max-width: 520px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.hi-impact__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 0;\n  border-top: 2px solid var(--color-black);\n  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-impact-stat {\n  padding: 60px 48px;\n  border-right: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-impact-stat:last-child { border-right: none; }\n.hi-impact-stat__num {\n  font-family: 'Montserrat', inherit, sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(52px, 6vw, 88px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.04em;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  line-height: 1;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n.hi-impact-stat__num span {\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n}\n.hi-impact-stat__label {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n.hi-impact-stat__desc {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  max-width: 260px;\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   8. QUOTE\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-quote {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: var(--color-black);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.hi-quote__inner {\n  text-align: center;\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n  max-width: 820px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.hi-quote__text {\n  font-size: clamp(22px, 3.2vw, 42px);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  color: var(--color-white);\n  margin-bottom: 40px;\n}\n.hi-quote__text em {\n  font-style: normal;\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n}\n.hi-quote__line {\n  width: 40px;\n  height: 2px;\n  background: var(--color-orange);\n  margin: 0 auto 24px;\n}\n.hi-quote__author {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   9. NEWSLETTER\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-newsletter {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-newsletter__inner {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 80px;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__title {\n  font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 42px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.05;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__text {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n}\n/* Formulário de newsletter — integre com HubSpot ou Klaviyo antes de publicar */\n.hi-newsletter__form {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__field {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__label {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-newsletter__input {\n  font-family: var(--font-main);\n  font-size: 15px;\n  padding: 14px 18px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  background: var(--color-bg-light);\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  transition: var(--transition);\n  outline: none;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__input:focus {\n  border-color: var(--color-black);\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(17,17,17,0.06);\n}\n.hi-newsletter__checks {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__check {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 10px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n}\n.hi-newsletter__check input[type=\"checkbox\"] {\n  margin-top: 2px;\n  accent-color: var(--color-black);\n  width: 15px;\n  height: 15px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n/* ── HubSpot embed override ── */\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap {\n  background: var(--color-bg-light);\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  padding: 36px 32px;\n}\n/* Reset agressivo — anula estilos do tema Shopify dentro do form */\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap ul,\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap li {\n  list-style: none !important;\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form-field {\n  margin-bottom: 18px !important;\n  list-style: none !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form fieldset {\n  max-width: 100% !important;\n  border: none !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n  margin: 0 !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .hs-input:not([type=\"checkbox\"]):not([type=\"radio\"]) {\n  font-family: var(--font-main) !important;\n  font-size: 15px !important;\n  padding: 13px 16px !important;\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border) !important;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm) !important;\n  background: var(--color-white) !important;\n  color: var(--color-black) !important;\n  width: 100% !important;\n  outline: none !important;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s ease !important;\n  box-sizing: border-box !important;\n  -webkit-appearance: none !important;\n  appearance: none !important;\n  box-shadow: none !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .hs-input:not([type=\"checkbox\"]):not([type=\"radio\"]):focus {\n  border-color: var(--color-black) !important;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(17,17,17,0.06) !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form label {\n  font-family: var(--font-main) !important;\n  font-size: 11px !important;\n  font-weight: 700 !important;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em !important;\n  text-transform: uppercase !important;\n  color: var(--color-black) !important;\n  margin-bottom: 6px !important;\n  display: block !important;\n}\n/* Checkboxes: esconder o bullet e alinhar corretamente */\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .inputs-list {\n  list-style: none !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n  margin: 0 0 12px !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .inputs-list li {\n  list-style: none !important;\n  display: flex !important;\n  align-items: flex-start !important;\n  gap: 10px !important;\n  margin-bottom: 10px !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .inputs-list li::before,\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .inputs-list li::marker {\n  display: none !important;\n  content: none !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .inputs-list input[type=\"checkbox\"] {\n  width: 15px !important;\n  height: 15px !important;\n  flex-shrink: 0 !important;\n  margin-top: 2px !important;\n  accent-color: var(--color-black) !important;\n  cursor: pointer !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .inputs-list label {\n  font-size: 13px !important;\n  font-weight: 400 !important;\n  letter-spacing: 0 !important;\n  text-transform: none !important;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary) !important;\n  line-height: 1.5 !important;\n  cursor: pointer !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .hs-field-desc {\n  font-size: 12px !important;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary) !important;\n  margin-bottom: 8px !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .hs-submit .hs-button,\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form input[type=\"submit\"] {\n  font-family: var(--font-main) !important;\n  font-size: 13px !important;\n  font-weight: 700 !important;\n  letter-spacing: 0.06em !important;\n  text-transform: uppercase !important;\n  background: var(--color-black) !important;\n  color: var(--color-white) !important;\n  border: 2px solid var(--color-black) !important;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm) !important;\n  padding: 14px 32px !important;\n  cursor: pointer !important;\n  transition: background 0.22s ease, border-color 0.22s ease !important;\n  margin-top: 8px !important;\n  width: 100% !important;\n  -webkit-appearance: none !important;\n  appearance: none !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .hs-submit .hs-button:hover,\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form input[type=\"submit\"]:hover {\n  background: var(--color-orange) !important;\n  border-color: var(--color-orange) !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .hs-error-msgs {\n  font-size: 12px !important;\n  color: #c0392b !important;\n  list-style: none !important;\n  margin-top: 4px !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .hs-richtext,\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .hs-richtext p {\n  font-size: 12px !important;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary) !important;\n  line-height: 1.5 !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .submitted-message {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  padding: 20px;\n  background: var(--color-orange-soft);\n  border-left: 3px solid var(--color-orange);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   10. CTA B2B FINAL\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-cta-b2b {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: var(--color-orange);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top right, rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 0%, transparent 60%);\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b__inner {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr auto;\n  gap: 60px;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b__title {\n  font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 46px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b__text {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);\n  margin-bottom: 36px;\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b__btns {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b__person {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b__person-img {\n  width: 180px;\n  height: 180px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  object-position: top center;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  display: block;\n  filter: grayscale(20%);\n  transition: filter 0.4s ease;\n  border: 3px solid var(--color-orange);\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b__person-img:hover {\n  filter: grayscale(0%);\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b__person-tag {\n  background: var(--color-black);\n  color: var(--color-white);\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  padding: 6px 14px;\n  border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   RESPONSIVIDADE\n   ============================================================ */\n@media (max-width: 1024px) {\n  .hi-container { padding: 0 28px; }\n\n  .hi-b2b__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .hi-b2b-card:nth-child(2) { border-right: none; }\n  .hi-b2b-card:nth-child(3) { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }\n  .hi-b2b-card:nth-child(4) { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }\n\n  .hi-resources__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .hi-resource-card:nth-child(2) { border-right: none; }\n  .hi-resource-card:nth-child(3) { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }\n  .hi-resource-card:nth-child(4) { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .hi-container { padding: 0 20px; }\n\n  /* Hero */\n  .hi-hero { padding: 48px 0 0; }\n  .hi-hero__inner {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    min-height: auto;\n  }\n  .hi-hero__content {\n    padding: 0 0 40px;\n    order: 2;\n  }\n  .hi-hero__image-col {\n    order: 1;\n    height: 260px;\n  }\n  .hi-hero__ctas { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }\n  .hi-btn { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }\n  .hi-link-tertiary { width: auto; }\n\n  /* Profiles */\n  .hi-profiles__grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    border: none;\n  }\n  .hi-profile-card {\n    border-right: none;\n    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n\n  /* B2B */\n  .hi-b2b__top { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }\n  .hi-b2b__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .hi-b2b-card { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }\n  .hi-b2b-card:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n  .hi-b2b__cta { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }\n\n  /* Cases */\n  .hi-cases__header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }\n  .hi-cases__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n\n  /* Cursos */\n  .hi-courses__trails { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }\n  .hi-courses__header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }\n  .hi-trail__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n\n  /* Resources */\n  .hi-resources__header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }\n  .hi-resources__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; border: none; }\n  .hi-resource-card { border-right: none; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); margin-bottom: 12px; }\n\n  /* Impact */\n  .hi-impact__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; border-top: none; border-bottom: none; }\n  .hi-impact-stat {\n    border-right: none;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n    padding: 40px 0;\n  }\n  .hi-impact-stat:first-child { border-top: 2px solid var(--color-black); }\n  .hi-impact-stat:last-child { border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-black); }\n\n  /* Newsletter */\n  .hi-newsletter__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }\n\n  /* CTA B2B */\n  .hi-cta-b2b__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }\n  .hi-cta-b2b__btns { flex-direction: column; }\n  .hi-cta-b2b__person { display: none; }\n\n  /* FAQ */\n  .hi-faq__header { margin-bottom: 32px; }\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   11. FAQ\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-faq {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: var(--color-bg-light);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-faq__header {\n  margin-bottom: 52px;\n}\n.hi-faq__title {\n  font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 42px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.05;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n.hi-faq__intro {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  max-width: 540px;\n}\n.hi-faq__list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0;\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.hi-faq__item {\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-faq__item:last-child {\n  border-bottom: none;\n}\n.hi-faq__question {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  padding: 24px 28px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  list-style: none;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 16px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n  user-select: none;\n}\n.hi-faq__question::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n.hi-faq__question::after {\n  content: '+';\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  transition: transform 0.25s ease;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n.hi-faq__item[open] .hi-faq__question::after {\n  transform: rotate(45deg);\n}\n.hi-faq__item[open] .hi-faq__question {\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n}\n.hi-faq__item:hover .hi-faq__question {\n  background: var(--color-bg-light);\n}\n.hi-faq__item[open] {\n  background: var(--color-white);\n}\n.hi-faq__answer {\n  padding: 0 28px 24px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-faq__answer p {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.75;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  padding-top: 20px;\n  max-width: 720px;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"hi-home-redesign\">\n\n  <!-- ============================================================\n       1. HERO PRINCIPAL\n       ============================================================ -->\n  <section class=\"hi-hero\" aria-label=\"Hero principal\">\n    <div class=\"hi-container\">\n      <div class=\"hi-hero__inner\">\n\n        <!-- Coluna esquerda: conteúdo -->\n        <div class=\"hi-hero__content hi-reveal\">\n          <span class=\"hi-eyebrow\">Business Transformation &amp; Learning</span>\n          <h1 class=\"hi-hero__title\">\n            Aprenda a liderar,<br>\n            inovar e <em>decidir</em><br>\n            num mundo em<br>\n            transformação.\n          </h1>\n          <p class=\"hi-hero__subtitle\">\n            A Hyper Island desenvolve pessoas, times e organizações por meio de\n            experiências de aprendizagem, facilitação e transformação com\n            impacto real nos negócios.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"hi-hero__ctas\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.hyperisland.com.br/pages/cursos\" class=\"hi-btn hi-btn-primary\">Conheça nossos cursos</a>\n            <a href=\"https://www.hyperisland.com.br/pages/empresas\" class=\"hi-btn hi-btn-outline\">Soluções para empresas</a>\n            <a href=\"https://www.hyperisland.com.br/pages/recursos-gratuitos\" class=\"hi-link-tertiary\">Explorar ferramentas gratuitas</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Coluna direita: imagem editorial\n             Substitua o src abaixo por uma imagem real da Hyper Island (workshop, colaboração, liderança) -->\n        <div class=\"hi-hero__image-col hi-reveal hi-reveal-delay-2\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/1_Header_Cursos.jpg?v=1752072621\" alt=\"Equipe em experiência de aprendizagem colaborativa na Hyper Island\" class=\"hi-hero__img\">\n          <span class=\"hi-hero__badge\">Global · Since 1996</span>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ============================================================\n       2. BARRA DE ESCOLHA POR PERFIL\n       ============================================================ -->\n  <section class=\"hi-profiles\" aria-label=\"Para quem é a Hyper Island\">\n    <div class=\"hi-container\">\n      <div class=\"hi-profiles__header hi-reveal\">\n        <span class=\"hi-eyebrow\">Por onde começar</span>\n        <h2 class=\"hi-profiles__title\">Qual é o seu caminho?</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hi-profiles__grid\">\n\n        <article class=\"hi-profile-card hi-reveal hi-reveal-delay-1\">\n          <div class=\"hi-profile-card__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</div>\n          <h3 class=\"hi-profile-card__title\">Para líderes e profissionais</h3>\n          <p class=\"hi-profile-card__text\">\n            Cursos intensivos para desenvolver novas habilidades em liderança,\n            comunicação, futuros, inovação e inteligência artificial.\n          </p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.hyperisland.com.br/pages/cursos\" class=\"hi-profile-card__link\">Ver cursos</a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"hi-profile-card hi-reveal hi-reveal-delay-2\">\n          <div class=\"hi-profile-card__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</div>\n          <h3 class=\"hi-profile-card__title\">Para empresas</h3>\n          <p class=\"hi-profile-card__text\">\n            Jornadas customizadas para desenvolver cultura, liderança, inovação,\n            estratégia e transformação digital.\n          </p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.hyperisland.com.br/pages/empresas\" class=\"hi-profile-card__link\">Transformar minha organização</a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"hi-profile-card hi-reveal hi-reveal-delay-3\">\n          <div class=\"hi-profile-card__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</div>\n          <h3 class=\"hi-profile-card__title\">Para aprender agora</h3>\n          <p class=\"hi-profile-card__text\">\n            Ferramentas, assessments, artigos e recursos gratuitos para aplicar\n            novas práticas com seu time.\n          </p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.hyperisland.com.br/pages/recursos-gratuitos\" class=\"hi-profile-card__link\">Acessar recursos</a>\n        </article>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ============================================================\n       3. BUSINESS TRANSFORMATION\n       =============================